{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019nnfUs27a4fFRk3TEaiTx8","type":"tool_result","content":"- `new E.TileMap(o = {}) → map`: Walls standing on a floor (top-down, isometric, brawler). Either { rows: [...ASCII...], legend: { '#': 1, '@': 'hero' }, types, floorTex } (recommended) or { w, h, cells: [ids...], floor: [tags...], blocked: [0 | 1...], types, floorTex } (built in code: fill, setFloor; with no cells it starts as open floor).\n427:- `r.prop(name, x, y, z, o = {})` †: set dressing from E.prop: r.prop('torch', x, y, z, { size, color, flip, light: true, halo: true, bias, hides, footprint }) feet on the world point; flames animate and glow. light: true also adds a warm light to game.lights. A prop at least chest high (E.HEIGH\n430:- `r.shape(id, x, y, z = 0, o = {})` †: Queue a shape standing at (x, y, z), feet on the point, depth sorted like an actor: r.shape(id | entry, x, y, z, o). o: { facing (radians, where its front points; default PI/2, south, as written), scale, mats: { slot: material }, flip (mirror it x to -x be\n1089:- `E.PROPS: torch, candle, candelabra, chandelier, brazier, window, banner, pillar, statue, crate, barrel, chest, pot, sign, fence, lamp, door, tree, pine, bush, flowers, grass, rock, crystal, bones, skull, vines, cobweb, lantern, streetlamp, awning, hydrant, trashcan, firedrum, sandbags, cactu\n389:- `game.particles.dust(x, y, z, n, o = {})`: n puffs of dust from (x, y, z) that drift and fade. o: { speed: 30, color, size }\n390:- `game.particles.explosion(x, y, z, size = 1, o = {})`: a full explosion in one call: fireball, smoke, sparks, debris, shockwave ring, screen shake and flash, sound. explosion(x, y, z, size = 1, { debris: ['#6a5a4a'\n391:- `game.particles.fire(x, y, z, n = 6, o = {})`: fireball puffs for explosions and fire breath\n392:- `game.particles.glints(x, y, z, n = 5, color = '#fff6c0', spread = 10)`: twinkling star glints for magic, treasure and pickups\n395:- `game.particles.smoke(x, y, z, n = 4, o = {})`: rising smoke puffs: smoke(x, y, z, n, { size, color, dark, light })\n396:- `game.particles.sparks(x, y, z, n, dir = null, o = {})`: n bright sparks thrown from (x, y, z), every way or around angle dir (radians). o: { color, speed }\n483:- `game.hitFx(x, y, z, o = {})`: everything a good hit needs in one call: hit-stop, shake, an impact star, sparks along the hit direction, a sound, a damage number and a rumble on a gamepad. hitFx(x, y, z, { power: 1\n366:- `game.lights.add(x, y, z, radius, intensity = 1, o)` †: radius in world units; intensity ~0.5..1.5. opts: { color: '#ffaa55' (both lightings), shadow: true (GPU lighting: walls and casters block\n381:- `game.lights.tint = .32` †: how strongly lights add their own color, 0..1\n531:- `game.lights` †: canvas lighting (lights.enabled, lights.add in draw)\n836:- `E.tex.checker(x, y, o = {})`: checkerboard tiles (castle floors, bonus rooms). o: { a, b, size }\n837:- `E.tex.dirt(x, y, o = {})`: dirt, sand or snow: base color with soft noise and specks. o: { base, dark, light }\n838:- `E.tex.flagstone(x, y, pal, size = 16)`: stone flagstones with running-bond rows. pal: {stones:[hex..], mortar, hi, lo, speck}\n839:- `E.tex.grass(x, y, o = {})`: grass with darker tufts and a few flowers. o: { base, dark, light, flower } hex colors\n840:- `E.tex.plain(x, y, o = {})`: plain color with light noise, for roads, carpets and space floors. o: { base, amount }\n841:- `E.tex.planks(x, y, o = {})`: wooden floor boards running along x. o: { base, dark, line }\n842:- `E.tex.water(x, y, o = {})`: water with static ripple lines (baked, so it does not move). o: { base, dark, light }\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050250__x8ffc89/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04adf679-869d-4bcd-bcf3-495063b939db","uuid":"90b3ca09-abfb-464a-8199-16dc11323b1d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:05:24.575Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"- `new E.