{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K9ouqKjNFrjCApKkguM3Kp","type":"tool_result","content":"418:- `r.decal(fn, o)`: draw on the floor before the queue. opts.emissive (0..1) makes it glow under GPU lighting\n419:- `r.glowDisc(g, cx, cy, rad, color, a)`: glow halo from a cache: additive light rings (alpha style) or a dithered disc (dither style). a = 0..1 strength\n420:- `r.groundArc(x, y, r0, r1, a0, a1, color, alpha = 1, z = 0, g = this.tgt)`: a band of a ring on the ground from radius r0 to r1 and angle a0 to a1 (radians): melee telegraphs, sight cones\n421:- `r.groundDisc(x, y, rad, color, alpha = 1, z = 0)`: a dithered disc lying on the ground (radius in world units, z its height): shadows, auras, area attacks\n423:- `r.groundRing(x, y, rad, color, alpha = 1, z = 0)`: a ring lying on the ground (radius in world units)\n429:- `r.shadow(x, y, rad, alpha = .5, color = '#0c0818', z = 0)`: soft contact shadow under a character: a cached dithered ellipse, correct for the current view. z = height of the surface it falls on (0 = floor; the top of a block or platform otherwise)\n229:- `view.toGround(sx, sy)`: projected screen point -> ground point (z = 0). null in side view\n485:- `game.mouseGround()`: mouse position on the ground (world units), or null\n226:- `view.p(x, y, z = 0)`: world -> projected screen pixels (not yet camera-relative)\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050250__x8ffc89/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04adf679-869d-4bcd-bcf3-495063b939db","uuid":"14a63dfd-8791-4c78-9bcb-92ad8ce3baff","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:14:15.034Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"418:- `r.decal(fn, o)`: draw on the floor before the queue. opts.emissive (0..1) makes it glow under GPU lighting\n419:- `r.glowDisc(g, cx, cy, rad, color, a)`: glow halo from a cache: additive light rings (alpha style) or a dithered disc (dither style). a = 0..1 strength\n420:- `r.groundArc(x, y, r0, r1, a0, a1, color, alpha = 1, z = 0, g = this.tgt)`: a band of a ring on the ground from radius r0 to r1 and angle a0 to a1 (radians): melee telegraphs, sight cones\n421:- `r.groundDisc(x, y, rad, color, alpha = 1, z = 0)`: a dithered disc lying on the ground (radius in world units, z its height): shadows, auras, area attacks\n423:- `r.groundRing(x, y, rad, color, alpha = 1, z = 0)`: a ring lying on the ground (radius in world units)\n429:- `r.shadow(x, y, rad, alpha = .5, color = '#0c0818', z = 0)`: soft contact shadow under a character: a cached dithered ellipse, correct for the current view. z = height of the surface it falls on (0 = floor; the top of a block or platform otherwise)\n229:- `view.toGround(sx, sy)`: projected screen point -> ground point (z = 0). null in side view\n485:- `game.mouseGround()`: mouse position on the ground (world units), or null\n226:- `view.p(x, y, z = 0)`: world -> projected screen pixels (not yet camera-relative)","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050250__x8ffc89/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01K9ouqKjNFrjCApKkguM3Kp","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
