{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghuXvAwtGH5Y7NxCPDXu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Y62c5GK7CDCNbxQAPrqYbj","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050250__x8ffc89/work/Gauntletdown-Gauntlet-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-050250 && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='game/src/31-render.js'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"  if (DEV.hitboxes) {\",\"\"\"  // the mouse in the world: hovering a monster or generator outlines it and names it\n  const mh = W.heroes[0];\n  if (mh && mh.reticle && !mh.down) {\n    let best = null, bd = 12; for (const t of [...W.mons, ...W.gens]) { if (t.dead || (t.ch === 'y' && t.vis <= 0)) continue; const d = Math.hypot(t.x - mh.reticle.x, t.y - mh.reticle.y); if (d < bd) { bd = d; best = t; } }\n    if (best) { r.groundRing(best.x, best.y, (best.r || 6) + 3, '#ffffff', .9); const nm = best.T ? best.T.name : best.G.name, rk = best.rank; r.queue(best.x, best.y, 60, g => { const [sx, sy] = r.w(best.x, best.y, 52); E.font.text(g, nm + '  RANK ' + rk, sx, sy, '#ffffff', { align: 'center', outline: '#000', font: 'tiny' }); }); }\n  }\n  if (DEV.botThoughts) for (const h of W.heroes) if (h.bot) r.queue(h.x, h.y, 80, g => { const [sx, sy] = r.w(h.x, h.y, 56); E.font.text(g, h.bot.think || '-', sx, sy - 10, '#80ff80', { align: 'center', outline: '#000', font: 'tiny' }); });\n  if (DEV.flow && W.flow) { const me = W.heroes[0]; if (me) { const cx0 = Math.floor(me.x / TS), cy0 = Math.floor(me.y / TS); for (let dy = -6; dy <= 6; dy++) for (let dx = -8; dx <= 8; dx++) { const x = (cx0 + dx + .5) * TS, y = (cy0 + dy + .5) * TS, v = W.map.walkable(cx0 + dx, cy0 + dy) && W.flow.dir(x, y); if (v) r.groundArc && r.queue(x, y, 1, g => { const [sx, sy] = r.w(x, y, 0); px.line(g, sx, sy, sx + Math.round(v[0] * 5), sy + Math.round(v[1] * 3), '#40c0ff', 1); }); } } }\n  if (DEV.hitboxes) {\"\"\",1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='game/src/90-main.js'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"  def('lighting', 'Enhanced lighting', null);\",\"  def('lighting', 'Enhanced lighting', null);\\n  S.define({ key: 'voices', label: 'Voices', type: 'toggle', value: E.store.get('gauntletdown-voices', true), group: 'Sound', apply: (g, v) => { Voice.on = !!v; E.store.set('gauntletdown-voices', !!v); } });\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat > docs/DESIGNER.md <<'EOF'\n# Gauntletdown: designer notes\n\nEverything is data first. Add content by editing one table; the sim, the Dev Tools, the bot and the tests pick it up.\n\n- **A floor.** `PLAN` in `game/src/00-core.js` lists the descent: `{ kind: 'floor' | 'treasure' | 'boss', no, realm, name, size, rooms, gens, mons, doors, food, traps, force, runes, lava, spikes, bell, tithe, skip }`.\n  `genFloor(step, seed)` in `10-floors.js` turns an entry into ASCII rows (legend in `docs/LEGEND.md` form below) and `solvable(rows)` proves a hero with keys can reach the stairs.\n  A hand-drawn floor is just a `{ rows, meta }` object: pass it to `buildWorld(step, { rows, meta })`.\n- **A monster.** Add its glyph to `MON` (`00-core.js`), a rig to `monRig` (`20-world.js`), a behaviour `case` in `monStep` (`22-monsters.js`) and a generator to `GEN` / `GENDEF` + `drawGen` (`30-art.js`) if it breeds.\n- **An item.** `pickup()` in `21-sim.js` (the effect), a sprite in `30-art.js`, a legend char in `buildWorld`.\n- **A line for the Gaunt.** `LINES` in `00-core.js`; call `say('key', { hero })`. Priorities and cooldowns are in `say()`.\n- **A tuning value.** One row in `TUNE_DEF` (default, min, max, step, label) gives it a Dev slider, a save and a reset.\n- **A hero.** One entry in `CLASSES`.\n\nLegend: `#` wall, `X` cracked wall, `+` door, `T`/`Y` trap walls (opened by `^`/`v` plates), `?` fake wall, `~` lava, `=` table, `.` floor, `@` start, `E` stairs, `2`-`9` skip stairs, `O` transporter, `!` stun rune, `s` spikes, `|` `-` force field, `k` key, `f` roast, `b` loaf, `j` cider, `z` stew, `m` flask, `u` potion, `a` amulet, `$` gold, `*` gem, `h` chest, `l` locked chest, `w` crown, `P` platter, `B` bell, `g n o i y x t` monsters, `G N L I F S U` generators, `K` the king.\n\nRun `node build.mjs`, then `node tests/run.mjs` (prints only failures and a count).\nEOF\ncat > ENGINE-CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine changes\n\nNone. Gauntletdown runs on my-3D2dge v0.85.2 exactly as handed over (`my-3d2dge.js` is byte-identical to the handoff copy).\n\nWhat the game had to build around the engine (candidates for the engine):\n- a multi-source `FlowField` (several heroes, one field): `Flow` in `game/src/20-world.js`;\n- shots that bounce off walls and pierce: `shotsStep` in `21-sim.js`;\n- a fake wall that draws like a wall and walks like a floor: `W.fakes` in `20-world.js` / `31-render.js`;\n- Humanoid weapons for an axe, a bow and a shield (the rig knows sword, gun and staff);\n- a pause-menu custom item that closes the pause menu (needed `game.resume()` in `90-main.js`).\nEOF\nnode build.mjs && node tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -3"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5108,"cache_read_input_tokens":373560,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5108},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04adf679-869d-4bcd-bcf3-495063b939db","uuid":"eea7c03d-1c89-4aea-8031-1714c8e50e1a","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:42:54.529Z","request_id":"req_011CghuXupciGmABbYYgy7ZQ","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Y62c5GK7CDCNbxQAPrqYbj":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050250__x8ffc89/work/Gauntletdown-Gauntlet-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-050250 && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='game/src/31-render.js'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"  if (DEV.hitboxes) {\",\"\"\"  // the mouse in the world: hovering a monster or generator outlines it and names it\n  const mh = W.heroes[0];\n  if (mh && mh.reticle && !mh.down) {\n    let best = null, bd = 12; for (const t of [...W.mons, ...W.gens]) { if (t.dead || (t.ch === 'y' && t.vis <= 0)) continue; const d = Math.hypot(t.x - mh.reticle.x, t.y - mh.reticle.y); if (d < bd) { bd = d; best = t; } }\n    if (best) { r.groundRing(best.x, best.y, (best.r || 6) + 3, '#ffffff', .9); const nm = best.T ? best.T.name : best.G.name, rk = best.rank; r.queue(best.x, best.y, 60, g => { const [sx, sy] = r.w(best.x, best.y, 52); E.font.text(g, nm + '  RANK ' + rk, sx, sy, '#ffffff', { align: 'center', outline: '#000', font: 'tiny' }); }); }\n  }\n  if (DEV.botThoughts) for (const h of W.heroes) if (h.bot) r.queue(h.x, h.y, 80, g => { const [sx, sy] = r.w(h.x, h.y, 56); E.font.text(g, h.bot.think || '-', sx, sy - 10, '#80ff80', { align: 'center', outline: '#000', font: 'tiny' }); });\n  if (DEV.flow && W.flow) { const me = W.heroes[0]; if (me) { const cx0 = Math.floor(me.x / TS), cy0 = Math.floor(me.y / TS); for (let dy = -6; dy <= 6; dy++) for (let dx = -8; dx <= 8; dx++) { const x = (cx0 + dx + .5) * TS, y = (cy0 + dy + .5) * TS, v = W.map.walkable(cx0 + dx, cy0 + dy) && W.flow.dir(x, y); if (v) r.groundArc && r.queue(x, y, 1, g => { const [sx, sy] = r.w(x, y, 0); px.line(g, sx, sy, sx + Math.round(v[0] * 5), sy + Math.round(v[1] * 3), '#40c0ff', 1); }); } } }\n  if (DEV.hitboxes) {\"\"\",1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='game/src/90-main.js'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"  def('lighting', 'Enhanced lighting', null);\",\"  def('lighting', 'Enhanced lighting', null);\\n  S.define({ key: 'voices', label: 'Voices', type: 'toggle', value: E.store.get('gauntletdown-voices', true), group: 'Sound', apply: (g, v) => { Voice.on = !!v; E.store.set('gauntletdown-voices', !!v); } });\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat > docs/DESIGNER.md <<'EOF'\n# Gauntletdown: designer notes\n\nEverything is data first. Add content by editing one table; the sim, the Dev Tools, the bot and the tests pick it up.\n\n- **A floor.** `PLAN` in `game/src/00-core.js` lists the descent: `{ kind: 'floor' | 'treasure' | 'boss', no, realm, name, size, rooms, gens, mons, doors, food, traps, force, runes, lava, spikes, bell, tithe, skip }`.\n  `genFloor(step, seed)` in `10-floors.js` turns an entry into ASCII rows (legend in `docs/LEGEND.md` form below) and `solvable(rows)` proves a hero with keys can reach the stairs.\n  A hand-drawn floor is just a `{ rows, meta }` object: pass it to `buildWorld(step, { rows, meta })`.\n- **A monster.** Add its glyph to `MON` (`00-core.js`), a rig to `monRig` (`20-world.js`), a behaviour `case` in `monStep` (`22-monsters.js`) and a generator to `GEN` / `GENDEF` + `drawGen` (`30-art.js`) if it breeds.\n- **An item.** `pickup()` in `21-sim.js` (the effect), a sprite in `30-art.js`, a legend char in `buildWorld`.\n- **A line for the Gaunt.** `LINES` in `00-core.js`; call `say('key', { hero })`. Priorities and cooldowns are in `say()`.\n- **A tuning value.** One row in `TUNE_DEF` (default, min, max, step, label) gives it a Dev slider, a save and a reset.\n- **A hero.** One entry in `CLASSES`.\n\nLegend: `#` wall, `X` cracked wall, `+` door, `T`/`Y` trap walls (opened by `^`/`v` plates), `?` fake wall, `~` lava, `=` table, `.` floor, `@` start, `E` stairs, `2`-`9` skip stairs, `O` transporter, `!` stun rune, `s` spikes, `|` `-` force field, `k` key, `f` roast, `b` loaf, `j` cider, `z` stew, `m` flask, `u` potion, `a` amulet, `$` gold, `*` gem, `h` chest, `l` locked chest, `w` crown, `P` platter, `B` bell, `g n o i y x t` monsters, `G N L I F S U` generators, `K` the king.\n\nRun `node build.mjs`, then `node tests/run.mjs` (prints only failures and a count).\nEOF\ncat > ENGINE-CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine changes\n\nNone. Gauntletdown runs on my-3D2dge v0.85.2 exactly as handed over (`my-3d2dge.js` is byte-identical to the handoff copy).\n\nWhat the game had to build around the engine (candidates for the engine):\n- a multi-source `FlowField` (several heroes, one field): `Flow` in `game/src/20-world.js`;\n- shots that bounce off walls and pierce: `shotsStep` in `21-sim.js`;\n- a fake wall that draws like a wall and walks like a floor: `W.fakes` in `20-world.js` / `31-render.js`;\n- Humanoid weapons for an axe, a bow and a shield (the rig knows sword, gun and staff);\n- a pause-menu custom item that closes the pause menu (needed `game.resume()` in `90-main.js`).\nEOF\nnode build.mjs && node tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -3"}}}
