{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The artifacts exist and the final reply contains all four sections, but 'every feature in TASK.md is implemented' is not established. The transcript shows TASK.md read in partial chunks (head, a middle slice and a tail, plus the Attract/UI section) rather than one complete read, and the claimed 'full' read is asserted. Audio was never heard, and no physical DualSense or real touch device was tested; the touch-only notice was checked only with a forced pointer override. The 84-floor sweep result (0 stalls) is shown, so that part is evidenced."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04adf679-869d-4bcd-bcf3-495063b939db","uuid":"4b74f457-f664-4108-8385-3a28a35d5ddd","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:11:47.742Z","isSynthetic":true}
